      "parameters": {
        "content": "WF04 - Image to Post. Approval-required mode: every draft goes to Telegram and nothing is published without an Approve tap. Needs: Google Drive folder, n8n variables META_PAGE_ID, IG_USER_ID, ADMIN_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID (optional META_GRAPH_API_VERSION, default v23.0), credentials for Google Drive, Telegram, Facebook Page access token and OpenAI. Instagram needs a public image URL, so the image is first uploaded to the Page as an unpublished photo. Auto-publish is not implemented. Drafts are deduped by Drive file ID and checksum.",
